14:04.095 --> 14:06.347
but that's what happens
when you challenge someone's faith.

14:06.431 --> 14:11.061
Oh, Peter, I know this is important to you,
but I don't wanna see you humiliated.

14:11.185 --> 14:14.063
I don't think anyone's gonna
wanna worship the Fonz.

14:14.147 --> 14:16.399
- Is this the Church of the Fonz?
- Yes, it is.

14:16.524 --> 14:19.319
I read your flyer.
Finally, a religion that makes sense to me.

14:19.443 --> 14:21.112
Hey, everyone. I found him. Over here.

14:24.740 --> 14:27.743
Oh, there you are. You would not believe
the morning I've had.

15:04.321 --> 15:06.032
What in blazes is this?

15:06.157 --> 15:07.658
I thought you said
we were going to church.

15:07.783 --> 15:12.080
This is church, Francis, a new church,
created by a man who was brave enough

15:12.163 --> 15:13.455
to follow his own vision.

15:15.374 --> 15:16.542
Please rise.

15:17.626 --> 15:19.045
Now sit on it.

15:19.170 --> 15:20.211
The Fonz be with you.

15:20.337 --> 15:21.380
And also with you.

15:21.506 --> 15:24.800
- Let us "Eh. "
- "Eh. "

15:25.010 --> 15:27.303
Wow, I can't believe
people are actually buying this.

15:27.387 --> 15:28.929
Hey, Fonzie's cool, Brian.

15:29.054 --> 15:32.642
You see, deep down, I think we all
secretly yearn to be Italian and stupid.

15:32.725 --> 15:35.810
A reading from the letters
of Potsie to the Tuscaderos.

15:36.019 --> 15:40.816
Yea, and did Fonzie downstairs cometh
from his apartment above the garage.

15:41.317 --> 15:45.655
And sayeth he, " Reassembleth will I
